# Infected (ULUS10054 v1.02) end-to-end regression pad log. Mission 1 NEW MEAT won, results accepted on CAMPAIGN, save written.
# Format of INFECTED_PAD_SCRIPT and of the Vita config key pad_script_file. One step per line, flip number then colon then buttons joined by plus
# and optionally LX=n and LY=n (0 to 255, 128 is the centre). A step holds until the next one.
# Flips count sceDisplaySetFrameBuf calls from boot under the deterministic virtual clock (see replay_check.sh and README.md).
# Recorded from the in-process bot (tools/bot) with INFECTED_BOT_PARAMS=phase=0 on lean code. Expected outcome is in mission1_win.expect.
# No colon may appear in a comment line (the desktop file reader turns newlines into commas and does not skip comments).
